:1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-05-12T21:07:23Z","updated_at":"2026-05-12T21:21:17Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.6-stable.\n\n### System information\n\nLinux\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen accessing properties, Godot may create a temporary instance only to read its default values, in [`ClassDB::class_get_default_property_value`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/eb7cfe13625ce49d57834b3fbbc96df8f0cbf447/core/object/class_db.cpp#L2172). Here's the relevant context:\n\n```cpp\n if (ClassDB::can_instantiate(p_class) && !ClassDB::is_virtual(p_class)) {\n      c = ClassDB::instantiate_no_placeholders(p_class);   // creates RefCounted instance\n      ...\n  }\n  if (c) {\n      List<PropertyInfo> plist;\n      c->get_property_list(&plist);\n      for (const PropertyInfo &E : plist) {\n          if (E.usage & (PROPERTY_USAGE_STORAGE | PROPERTY_USAGE_EDITOR)) {\n              ...\n              Variant v = c->get(E.name);                  // (1) custom getter is called\n              default_values[p_class][E.name] = v;         // (2) getter's return value is stored permanently\n          }\n      }\n      if (cleanup_c) {\n          memdelete(c);                                    // (3) temporary instance is deleted again\n      }\n  }\n```\n\nIn my case:\n- the instance inherits `RefCounted`\n- (1) returned a `Callable`, which captured a `Ref<...>` to the object itself (incrementing ref-count)\n- (2) this extra ref remains alive in the default-value cache\n- (3) the instance is deleted\n- the cached (2) is now a zombie ref; it still has ref-count 1 and thinks the object is alive\n- once (2) is accessed/destroyed, we have use-after-free/double-free -> UB\n\nThe main problem is that the `memdelete(c)` assumes that the object is manually-managed. It bypasses a potential `RefCounted::unreference` call if `c` is a reference-counted instance.\n\ncc @Ivorforce \n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSee above, or alternatively regression test in https://github.com/godot-rust/gdext/pull/1589.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119425/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119425/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}